{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ride Through the City</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/Ride_Through_the_City.gif?t=1744703429\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push your cart and ride through the bustling streets, find the best location to sell your hotdogs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buy Sources &amp; Ingredients</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/Buy_Sauces___Ingredients.gif?t=1744703429\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stock up on a variety of sources and fresh ingredients to create mouthwatering hotdogs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Prepare Delicious Hotdogs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/Prepare_Delicious_Hotdogs!.gif?t=1744703429\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a variety of delicious sauces and toppings, then serve up your tasty creations to hungry customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make a Profit!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/Make_a_Profit!.gif?t=1744703429\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set your prices, manage your stock, and grow your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize Your Cart!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/Customize_Your_Cart!.gif?t=1744703429\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your cart with new designs, cool add-ons, and fancy accessories. Make it stand out and attract more hungry customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the City!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/Explore_the_City!.gif?t=1744703429\" />From sunny beaches to busy downtown streets. Discover every corner of the city!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3370540?t=1744703429","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3370540?t=1744703429","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/c5a687d436b2012d7f62df18da7baed4b317ef89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744703429","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/c5a687d436b2012d7f62df18da7baed4b317ef89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744703429","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>DON'T FORGET TO WHISTLIST!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/addtowishlist_gif.gif?t=1744703429\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ride Through the City</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370540/extras/Ride_Through_the_City.gif?t=1744703429\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push your cart and ride through the bustling streets, find the best location to sell your hotdogs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buy Sources &amp; Ingredients</strong></p><p class=\"bb